  "body": "[formfm~] is a FM formant oscillator (actually phase modulation) where you specify the fundamental (f0) frequency, the center (or formant) frequency as a ratio and the bandwidth (as the modulation index). This is an abstraction based on Pd's F10 example (sweepable FM). The object has support for multichannels."
